## Why This Is Asked
Tests CRDT knowledge, offline collaboration, and practical data modeling for cross-device sync. It also evaluates how to bound growth, ensure deterministic reconciliation, and integrate with a common iOS stack.

## Key Concepts
- CRDTs: OR-Set for attachments, observed-remove with vector clocks for changes
- Append-only logs and per-Asset clocks
- Deterministic reconciliation on reconnect
- Realm/SQLite as storage backends
- Lightweight conflict resolver and delta generation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Simple OR-Set merge sketch (JS for illustration)
function mergeORSet(localAdds, remoteAdds, localRemoves, remoteRemoves) {
  const adds = new Set([...localAdds, ...remoteAdds]);
  const removes = new Set([...localRemoves, ...remoteRemoves]);
  return Array.from(adds).filter(x => !removes.has(x));
}
```

